    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ac70a88080b55c66eab250e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在，我只在乎近在眼前的――『秋华赏』。\n……我想要赢。\n就算在距离上会很难、也是。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c53f3c07196857d79a40b3c5016f77aaa201e01572d18089a8f88f356480aa38",
