      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "别这么说，你已经为我费了很多心思了。\n可是，却还是找不到就意味着……\n果然――",
      "source_fingerprint": "adba5b2ac966acda9a3cdfaeab048653ef93f7fc186efdc20cbbb83c38495559",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
