    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ace1f2213fc516d78bb5819",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "竞争对手们都拥有出色的武器。\n但是，若是因为比较而丧失了自信……\n就连她原本的优点都会发挥不出来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcdb18d32d8b5fa41c8537d04cba8bd8db70510bcdccadfeb0047d7966036e8e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
